    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0434" n="318" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg318"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.6112/16.</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 450.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-10-01">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi> 1, 1912</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my despatch No. 434 of the
                    20th ultimo and to previous correspondence in regard to the Ciénaga de Zapata
                    concession, I have the honor to transmit herewith enclosed (in compliance with
                    the request of Mr. Isaac K. Champion) copy<anchor n="1" xml:id="d449-f1"/> of
                    the opinion of his attorney as to the legality of the Zapata concession and
                        copies<anchor n="1" xml:id="d449-f2"/> and translations of various
                    communications addressed to the company and to the President of the Republic by
                    municipal governments and property owners who express themselves as favoring the
                    granting of the company’s concession.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hugh S. Gibson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
